        </div>
        <div class="glass-light px-6 py-4 flex items-center gap-4">
          <span class="text-amber-400 text-xl shrink-0">&#9672;</span>
          <div><p class="text-white text-xs font-semibold">Corporate Leases</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-xs mt-0.5">30-day minimum</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="glass-light px-6 py-4 flex items-center gap-4">
          <span class="text-amber-400 text-xl shrink-0">&#9673;</span>
          <div><p class="text-white text-xs font-semibold">Beverly Hills Adjacent</p><p class="text-slate-500 text-xs mt-0.5">Beverlywood 90035</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-28 bg-midnight-950">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-20 items-center">
      <div>
        <p class="text-amber-400 text-xs tracking-[0.4em] uppercase mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="w-8 h-px bg-amber-400"></span>
          Why Executives Choose This Property
        </p>
        <h2 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl text-white mb-8 leading-tight">Built for<br /><em class="text-gradient">Executive Life</em></h2>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          9432 Oakmore Rd is the only fully furnished gated compound in Beverlywood available for corporate lease.
          Designed for executives who demand privacy, space, and proximity to LA business corridor.
        </p>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-3 mb-10 text-xs">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-400"><span class="w-1 h-1 bg-amber-400 rounded-full shrink-0"></span>Fully furnished - no setup, no vendors, just arrive</div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-400"><span class="w-1 h-1 bg-amber-400 rounded-full shrink-0"></span>Gated compound - privacy and security for principals</div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-400"><span class="w-1 h-1 bg-amber-400 rounded-full shrink-0"></span>Detached guest house - host staff or board members</div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-400"><span class="w-1 h-1 bg-amber-400 rounded-full shrink-0"></span>EV charging on-site - Tesla, Rivian, BMW ready</div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-400"><span class="w-1 h-1 bg-amber-400 rounded-full shrink-0"></span>Smart home multi-zone HVAC</div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-400"><span class="w-1 h-1 bg-amber-400 rounded-full shrink-0"></span>Corporate lease accepted - company name on lease</div>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-slate-400"><span class="w-1 h-1 bg-amber-400 rounded-full shrink-0"></span>30-day minimum - flexible for project-based relocation</div>
        </div>
        <a href="https://calendly.com/theissakgroup/30min" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="bg-amber-400 text-midnight-950 font-semibold text-xs tracking-widest uppercase px-7 py-3.5 hover:bg-amber-300 transition-all duration-300 amber-glow-hover">Book a Private Tour</a>
      </div>
      <div class="relative">
